      "settings": {
        "content": "<p>We take helping in looking after our planet seriously at William Wood. For every order placed, we pledge the following actions.</p><p></p><p>1. We plant one tree in partnership with ecodrive</p><p>2. We offset all of our carbon emissions produced from shipping in partnership with Shopify Planet</p><p>3. We donate a proportion of our monthly revenue to preventing plastic from reaching our oceans in partnership with CleanHub</p>"
      },
      "blocks": {}
    },
    "rich_text_6dJDQY": {
      "settings": {
        "content": "<p>In addition, we use 100% Sustainably Sourced Paulownia Wood for almost all of our wooden framed mirrors.</p>"
      },
      "blocks": {}
    },
